{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"東張女神廖倬竩即將結婚？  標註婚紗公司怒晒傲人上圍  廖創興銀行創辦人曾孫女惹熱議\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c83b1465485ce5688904af66afeb0d09/2026-11/20261112_ENT_ENT___0.png\"/>\n<p>現年32歲的《東張西望》主持廖倬竩（Ivy），早前在採訪中勇猛阻截「拳王渣男」母親甩門逃跑，更義正嚴詞怒斥對方「你仲係唔係人！」，憑藉超強正義感的霸氣表現，獲網民封為新一代「香港女神」。這位悍勇的「正義女神」近日搖身一變，疑化身最美待嫁新娘。近日廖倬竩在社交平台IG上載了多張身處婚紗晚裝公司的靚相，高調標註本地婚紗店，並寫道「Pick a look! 」大派福利，旋即引來網民瘋狂洗版，猜測她即將結婚，紛紛大喊她是「最美新娘」。</p>\n<h2>廖倬竩發放性感「婚紗」福利？</h2>\n<p>相片中的廖倬竩置身於璀璨的鏡子前，一口氣試穿了多套令人窒息的性感晚裝。其中一套粉色平口抹胸短裙，胸前深V剪裁直逼肚臍，裙身綴滿精緻立體花卉，下擺拼接花瓣流蘇，將她的豐滿上圍與逆天長腿展露無遺，既甜美又極具誘惑；另一款同色系的長裙版晚禮服則配有澎湃的蓬蓬裙擺，隨着她輕撫裙擺轉身，流露出高貴優雅的公主氣場。此外，她還挑戰了一款銀白色低胸短裙，肩膀融入誇張的羽毛設計，胸前大開中門，裙擺佈滿閃爍的銀絲流蘇，伴隨姿態搖曳生姿，仙氣與性感並重。</p>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩是《東張西望》主持之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5336225b1da0df6831194c1f3312235e/2025-08/IVY_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩曾入圍台慶頒獎禮「最佳女主持」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a288809f53452461b81e893f5c5a280/2024-01/Ivy_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩一直做主持工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/352521183c780507e103ff841933eb6a/2024-01/Ivy_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩於《東張西望》中的低胸短裙造型極養眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b81e9ee7a8e35d55262cdb90d8d44ea2/2026-03/177296473853733.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩於婚紗公司試多款性感服裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0b8ca0e3944da5dc2dac497990ea4e7/2026-11/1_4_64.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩盡顯美好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cacb9f90dc8bb2c724c70a809c805ffb/2026-11/2_3_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩中門大開相當性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1455c16faf9154691bab1d528abcca9/2026-11/3_0_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩造型美絕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/541885ab2e1a5b4de0d16ba28e576027/2026-11/4_7_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩靚到震。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dc266f03150aa9da6dec991a5afe3a7/2026-11/5_0_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5b00519fcb26501e87fa2fa11b6409d/2026-11/6_2_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩美不勝收。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7b90b29120eccf44f658478121d3c8b/2026-11/7_2_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩試着多套性感晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07ba48082a2b32a49444dc0b5cc34310/2026-11/8_1_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩香港潮商望族、廖創興銀行創辦人廖寶珊家族的顯赫後人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/131ccfe215a4a0cd99d89d16749eed7e/2025-08/IVY_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩近期在《東張西望》採訪中，因陪同遭騙財騙色的女事主上門與「拳王渣男」的父母對質而爆紅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85dcffbeee72a73bca1559eea7608fbd/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797189_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"少女的遭遇讓廖倬竩落淚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e150df90bdb2b6db228a52ff3d8cfc8f/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797193_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩帶少女上門找渣男。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9da586c8c605b92a8014db66bf5b836d/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797195_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩非常勇悍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c28be869e3caf3fdefd2445d0f913d4f/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797195_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩撳實度門不讓渣男母閂門。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/504ea913224a1ee2de6a5921bae26087/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797195_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩興問罪之師。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afe620591d9c13d6fe3abaa217e472ec/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797196_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩狂數賤母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4148e058a32a4a3a4e66b8648520ef30/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797197_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"拳王渣男cut廖倬竩線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/254ab19aaa3bebe4549ef3128fcb788a/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29797198_11_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>廖倬竩家世顯赫</h2>\n<p>隨着廖倬竩「試嫁衣」消息掀起熱議，她的顯赫家世亦再度備受關注。原來這位作風低調的「東張女神」是百億老牌家族的「富四代」，為香港潮商望族、創興銀行創辦人廖寶珊家族的後人——她是廖寶珊六子廖烈道之孫女、廖德城之女，其堂姑母則是創辦知名連鎖咖啡店的著名企業家廖偉芬。廖倬竩畢業於英國伯明翰大學國際關係系，2019年參選港姐止步10強後簽約TVB，因流利英語主持明珠台節目《至尚生活》，直至2023年加入《東張西望》常以健康性感裝束出鏡而備受注目。</p>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩入行以來未有透露家庭背景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed134534725f1c4f60d13a77d5c4a579/2025-10/ivaliu_ivy_1761056088_3748332604371390361_8135191267.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩早前加入潮陽同鄉會🇨🇳並出席見面會，獲頒發證書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d20e6571096ecb1728a1fa439dfb4032/2025-10/ivaliu_ivy_1761056088_3748332604371419153_8135191267.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩穿上黑色大花裙領取證書，看起來相當成熟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8a2b5745887f34a97cf5e82753e590d/2025-10/ivaliu_ivy_1761056088_3748332604740514867_8135191267.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩參加《2019年度香港小姐競選》，最終未有奪得名次。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0d6653c317d772f17226fc3c6faf07de/2023-09/1_3_114.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩當年選港姐與梁敏巧同屆。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec5eb3e2b0072d1bebd75ae0ce3fe3ec/2023-09/2_1_53.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩（左二）參選時身形有點胖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/06d9e5147f90fab6c5585f7c81bd4ef1/2023-09/3_1_42.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩（左）參選時仍Baby fat。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/47314787d9dc924f44c97243df3aab0a/2023-09/L1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩參選時外貌和身材未在狀態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23bec6a861bcd9156f005a8d683fbcec/2023-09/L4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩同屆港姐黃嘉雯奪得冠軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/37fe93251111b49da90314b3bff95dc5/2023-09/L2_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩主持《至尚生活》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a97313e04819095c5416f9db5b8685e9/2023-09/370455666_18202204207271268_2548324523128738926_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩的照片好有美感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1336a94f52dcff9c8c58fe94f93634fc/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩身材很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d80624efb1c0de7beeed6f6889bfa8fc/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩的頸鍊惹人注目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d51974090cf2ef803ccc771543311ccd/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民對廖倬竩所戴的飾物有意見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62d0f1e681092c1dc877a8d83b327b58/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩英文非常流利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3be2e758401b5363c27ccef54f596709/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩曾在明珠台做主播。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ede6c8890f29321a9993ded120712167/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩在明珠台財經節目《股市直擊》做主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10c6e96fb1109007345e98dc90cbb1e7/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩講美股走勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6328bb5edd2311b5e618e8a0aa8379e/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩大晒長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/701ca572389a7359689432e49657c9ba/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩是新一代「東張女神」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f1e1524fd7c37c0297ffb7ab32c44c0/2023-09/Ivy_Liu_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩身材極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bee7eccc949d6d4088b5e56e51fda432/2023-09/324881856_234387548916564_3689668137188449604_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩曾做主播。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b09ed9a3f988e1d9bebd78ce092facb8/2023-09/341897387_3162616927371014_8118709620430796544_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩曾在網上拍英文教學短片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/754b43846827ee53193bd29ea397a80c/2023-09/343154039_243233798233020_2194558958885115319_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60fd719c2f70ae4281b360081ac043bb/2023-09/347561775_18194615767271268_5393057616948936818_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩2022年起兼任《港生活．港享受》主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e634055d5d8ebd6d944fbf53ffdc7d7/2023-09/356020335_1391148381443776_1252543985774473847_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩選完港姐一直留在TVB發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a956eae820c435a4185b754506c2139c/2023-09/370945727_18201656293271268_2690165210746770922_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖倬竩考獲咖啡品質鑑定師資格。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/356a1bc45f43554e8e7cd8d6274b118a/2024-01/Ivy_1_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:23:57.225753+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":704,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:18:00.164397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:26.969443+00:00","content_hash":"d67c7cbe8eab398a6e26df95da622ff303aa75c40c876c03142f68b79e41fdbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}